{"ref":"BDB, חֶלְדַּי","hw":"חֶלְדַּי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֶלְדַּי</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  one of David’s heroes <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.15\">1 Ch 27:15</a> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵלֶד</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:30\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.30\">11:30</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵלֶב</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:29\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.29\">2 S 23:29</a>) 𝔊 Χολδεια (—δαι), 𝔊L Ολδια.<br><strong>2.</strong>  a returned exile <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 6:10\" href=\"/Zechariah.6.10\">Zc 6:10</a> (om. 𝔊) = <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵלֶם</span> v <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 6:14\" href=\"/Zechariah.6.14\">14</a>.","next":"BDB, חָלָה","prev":"BDB, חֻלְדָּה"}